    excerpt: "Advanced Laser Surgery at SRM Global Hospitals Restores Urinary Function in Iraqi Senior Citizen with High-Risk Cardiac Condition Benign Prostatic Enlargement affects 50\–60% of men above 60, making it a leading urological condition HoLEP, a minimally invasive laser surgery, enables precise tissue removal with minimal bleeding and quick recovery Chennai, November xx 2025: SRM Global ...",
    year: "2025",
