    excerpt: "Globally, only about ten cases of the cyst inside the pericardium have been reported in the published literature so far. The medical team successfully avoided intensive procedures that would have required stopping the heart and lung functions. Chennai, 18 December 2024: A 50-year-old woman from Puducherry became the first patient to be treated for a ...",
    year: "2024",
