    excerpt: "Observed annually on 25 May, aims to raise awareness on thyroid disorders, early detection, and management. Chennai, May 24, 2024: Thyroid cancer is the most common cancer of the endocrine system and occurs in all age groups. In India, the number of new cases of thyroid cancer is 13.9 per 100,000 men and women per ...",
    year: "2024",
